  "an5.135:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 5.135 ",
  "an5.135:0.2": "14. Kings ",
  "an5.135:0.3": "Aspiration (1st) ",
  "an5.135:1.1": "“Mendicants, an anointed aristocratic king’s eldest son with five factors aspires to kingship. ",
  "an5.135:1.2": "What five? ",
  "an5.135:1.3": "It’s when an anointed aristocratic king’s eldest son is well born on both his mother’s and father’s side, stemming from a clean vessel, with irrefutable and impeccable genealogy back to the seventh paternal generation. ",
  "an5.135:1.4": "He is attractive, good-looking, lovely, of surpassing beauty. ",
  "an5.135:1.5": "He is dear and beloved to his parents. ",
  "an5.135:1.6": "He is dear and beloved to the people of town and country. ",
  "an5.135:1.7": "He is trained and skilled in the arts of anointed aristocratic kings, such as elephant riding, horse riding, driving a chariot, archery, and swordsmanship. ",
  "an5.135:2.1": "He thinks: ",
  "an5.135:2.2": "‘I’m well born on both my mother’s and father’s side, stemming from a clean vessel, with irrefutable and impeccable genealogy back to the seventh paternal generation. ",
  "an5.135:2.3": "Why shouldn’t I aspire to kingship? ",
  "an5.135:2.4": "I’m attractive, good-looking, lovely, of surpassing beauty. ",
  "an5.135:2.5": "Why shouldn’t I aspire to kingship? ",
  "an5.135:2.6": "I’m dear and beloved to my parents. ",
  "an5.135:2.7": "Why shouldn’t I aspire to kingship? ",
  "an5.135:2.8": "I’m dear and beloved to the people of town and count